 you're ready to go to production.",[186,238,239],{},"Here's how to authenticate your requests using cURL:",[241,242,247],"pre",{"className":243,"code":244,"filename":245,"language":246,"meta":105,"style":105},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","curl https://api.vatly.com/v1/checkouts \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here\"\n","Example request with API key","bash",[190,248,249,266],{"__ignoreMap":105},[250,251,254,258,262],"span",{"class":252,"line":253},"line",1,[250,255,257],{"class":256},"sBMFI","curl",[250,259,261],{"class":260},"sfazB"," https://api.vatly.com/v1/checkouts",[250,263,265],{"class":264},"sTEyZ"," \\\n",[250,267,269,272,276,279],{"class":252,"line":268},2,[250,270,271],{"class":260},"  -H",[250,273,275],{"class":274},"sMK4o"," \"",[250,277,278],{"class":260},"Authorization: Bearer live_your_api_key_here",[250,280,281],{"class":274},"\"\n",[186,283,284],{},"Always keep your API key safe and never expose it in client-side code or commit it to version control. If you suspect your API key has been compromised, you can regenerate it from the Vatly dashboard.",[181,286,288],{"id":287},"using-an-sdk","Using an SDK",[186,290,291],{},"If you use one of our official SDKs, authentication is straightforward. Simply provide your API key when initializing the client, and the SDK will handle the rest.",[241,293,298],{"className":294,"code":295,"filename":296,"language":297,"meta":105,"style":105},"language-php shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","$vatly = new Vatly\\Api\\VatlyApiClient;\n$vatly->setApiKey('live_your_api_key_here');\n","PHP SDK example","php",[190,299,300,332],{"__ignoreMap":105},[250,301,302,305,308,311,315,318,321,324,326,329],{"class":252,"line":253},[250,303,304],{"class":274},"$",[250,306,307],{"class":264},"vatly ",[250,309,310],{"class":274},"=",[250,312,314],{"class":313},"sbssI"," new",[250,316,317],{"class":264}